00:55:23,076 --> 00:55:29,076
Diamonds Are Forever is a 1971 spy film and the seventh film in
the James Bond series produced by Eon Productions.

13
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
It is the sixth and final Eon film to star Sean Connery, who returned to the role as the fictional MI6 agent
James Bond, having declined to reprise the role in On Her Majesty's Secret Service (1969).

14
01:04:36,923 --> 01:04:42,923
The film is based on Ian Fleming's 1956 novel and is the second
of four Bond films directed by Guy Hamilton.

15
01:09:13,846 --> 01:09:19,846
The story has Bond impersonating a diamond smuggler to infiltrate a smuggling ring and uncovering a plot by
his old enemy Ernst Stavro Blofeld to use the diamonds to build a space-based laser weapon.

16
01:13:50,769 --> 01:13:56,769
Bond sets out to stop the smuggling but discovers he must defeat Blofeld before he destroys
Washington, D.C., in his plan to blackmail the world with nuclear supremacy.

17
01:18:27,692 --> 01:18:33,692
After George Lazenby left the series, the producers Harry Saltzman and Albert R.

18
01:23:04,615 --> 01:23:10,615
Broccoli tested other actors, but the studio United Artists wanted Connery back,
paying a then-record US$1.25 million salary for him to return.

19
01:27:41,538 --> 01:27:47,538
The producers were inspired by Goldfinger; as with that film, Hamilton was
hired to direct, and Shirley Bassey performed the title song.

20
01:32:18,461 --> 01:32:24,461
Locations included Las Vegas, California, and Amsterdam.

21
01:36:55,384 --> 01:37:01,384
Diamonds Are Forever was a commercial success and
received positive reviews upon release.

22
01:41:32,307 --> 01:41:38,307
It was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Sound.

23
01:46:09,230 --> 01:46:15,230
Diamonds Are Forever was followed by Live and Let Die in 1973,
with Roger Moore succeeding Connery as Bond.

24
01:50:46,153 --> 01:50:52,153
The film explores themes of smuggling (contraband), fight,
amsterdam, netherlands, spy, secret organization.

25
01:55:23,076 --> 01:55:29,076
The tone is intense.
